{"rule":"lemma-pool/v1","groups":{"predador":{"host":"e99a24a8","siblings":["9d614b73"]}},"rows":{"9d614b73":{"word":"predadores","rank":8836,"meanings":[{"headword":"predador","pos":"noun","source_reference":"kaikki:en-predador-pt-noun-0a1egxJM","translation":"predator (animal that hunts and kills other animals)"}]}},"examples":{"9d614b73":{"m":[[{"t":"Elas são perigosas e não têm predadores naturais.","e":"They're dangerous, and they have no natural predators.","s":"tatoeba","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.889689,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"0a716ad5439a589b69938fd0006cc4bb","i":"1dfb7c29e5fcfa8d259e96cd4f222c9e","r":"1693946:1690478","c":"alexmarcelo","su":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1693946","ul":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1693946","b":"Tatoeba sentence #1693946 by alexmarcelo; English translation #1690478 by Spamster","o":"https://tatoeba.org/en/sentences/show/1693946","tu":1,"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Mas os predadores não devem sofrer com os meus erros.","e":"But predators shouldn't have to suffer for my mistakes.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.903592,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"c4ab7c0036c503f37a416bc2f32bd271","i":"35723a73f25f9f9c410f5e2418822792","r":"2948356:6659510:1562:2385078","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2948356","6659510","1562"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Os inimigos delas são o tempo, as doenças e os predadores.","e":"Their enemies are the weather, disease and predators.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.876726,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"2bd7238df0f67f203dd2586cf45a9a3f","i":"54c65a3835379f4d403d3c95fc23a9ff","r":"3168230:6359880:256:298426","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3168230","6359880","256"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Tão perigosa que só uns poucos predadores passam o ano todo aqui.","e":"So hazardous that few predators stay here all year.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.892608,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"c87a8fac5962aa2fa6d94b153afb9ec1","i":"669e0de208abc30740ee38b66ba50848","r":"5254370:6418214:4:2204804","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["5254370","6418214","4"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Então, só os predadores é que se estão a tornar selvagens?","e":"So, predators are the only ones going savage?","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.871145,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"c81d4997181224b2e7d952d77bac4c65","i":"7b30ae4765816b9438ae3514d59141e6","r":"2948356:6659510:1367:2384892","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2948356","6659510","1367"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Um mundo em que a presa temia os predadores.","e":"A world where prey were scared of predators.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.872808,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"3565d073f5a89b6cb1484d41ad2f38b1","i":"ccff1d73d289af5e84cd0e1151e422db","r":"2948356:6659510:6:2383610","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["2948356","6659510","6"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"Os oceanos estão cheios de vida, incluindo predadores, como tubarões.","e":"Oceans are teeming with life, including predators like sharks.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.8388,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"15dd491173cd949260f7aa60f5af6561","i":"369c0b94a12c702c7fd24d2a42b56387","r":"3403194:6674067:761:357279","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/OpenSubtitles-v2018.php","d":["3403194","6674067","761"],"w":["leaf",0]},{"t":"É como se a minha vida estivesse à mercê de predadores.","e":"I just feel like my life is at the mercy of predators.","s":"opensubtitles","ta":{"model":"sentence-transformers/LaBSE","score":0.752255,"version":"labse-cosine/v1"},"x":"794ef278d8829200941beb1397ec0ac9","i":"792b1024aa70b0e6bc3b0a60502dc5f9","r":"3991412:6923328:931:2551227","su":"http://opus.nlpl.eu/Ope